{"parse": {"title": "交接日-07", "pageid": 123642, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%A4%E6%8E%A5%E6%97%A5-06\" title=\"交接日-06\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">交接日-07</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%A4%E6%8E%A5%E6%97%A5-08\" title=\"交接日-08\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">交接日</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">07</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E8.BD.AC.E7.9E.AC.E7.9A.84.E6.9C.BA.E4.BC.9A\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"转瞬的机会\">转瞬的机会</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 转瞬的机会</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Seizing the Opportunity</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"></div></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"border: 1px solid; font-size: 14px; margin: 0 5px; display: inline-block; text-align: center; height: 20px; line-height: 18px; min-width: &#91;&#91;:模板:Width&#93;&#93;; color: #666; padding: 0 5px;\">11:30 禁闭室</span></div>\n<div class=\"no-indent\">\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory madierda pic 12.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png/110px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png/165px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6b/Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png/220px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_12.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"520\" data-file-height=\"556\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">禁闭室</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“好啦，故事就讲到这里，接下来你们两个要老老实实关禁闭了。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“既然你们对外面的世界那么感兴趣，下次就不要再调皮捣蛋了。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“这样明年，你们就能和大家一起去参加校外活动啦。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>玛蒂尔达正欲向两个孩子道别，却见到他们委屈地扁起了嘴。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>女孩：</b></span>“我们不捣蛋也不会被选上的。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“……选上？那是什么意思？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“校外活动日应该是所有学生都能参加的。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>男孩：</b></span>“去年是这样的。但今年，他们说只有评选上的人才能去……”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>男孩沮丧地低着头。他话语中透露的另一重意思让玛蒂尔达警觉了起来。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“你是说还有更多孩子留在学校里？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“——他们在哪里？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_madierda_pic_14.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory madierda pic 14.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Rolestory_madierda_pic_14.png/110px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_14.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"103\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Rolestory_madierda_pic_14.png/165px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_14.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d7/Rolestory_madierda_pic_14.png/220px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_14.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"475\" data-file-height=\"444\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">第一防线学校·教室</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>玛蒂尔达在敲门后直接推开了门。<br />\n教室中坐满了学生，但没人说话，闷着叫人喘不过气来的沉默。<br />\n她这名不速之客的造访，让所有那些懵懂的眼睛都看了过来。钢笔齐刷刷划过习题纸的声音停下，讲台后的纪律主任站起身来。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>纪律主任：</b></span>“莉娜、约翰？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>她不敢置信地看了看跟在玛蒂尔达后面的两个孩子，又看向教室最后排，两个书桌上堆起高高书本的座位。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>纪律主任：</b></span>“哈！你们两个永远也学不会反省，对不对？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>纪律主任：</b></span>“干得好，布翁尼小姐。你们过来！站到台上来——”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“哈珀女士，我是来找您的。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>玛蒂尔达打断了她的话。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“能请您出来一下吗？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>也许是从玛蒂尔达的眼神中读出了什么，纪律主任在狐疑地打量了玛蒂尔达片刻后，同意了这个提案。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>纪律主任：</b></span>“……你们继续自习，别让我发现谁捣乱。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div class=\"floatright\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Rolestory_madierda_pic_15.png\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Rolestory madierda pic 15.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/Rolestory_madierda_pic_15.png/110px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_15.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"110\" height=\"118\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/Rolestory_madierda_pic_15.png/165px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_15.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/Rolestory_madierda_pic_15.png/220px-Rolestory_madierda_pic_15.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"520\" data-file-height=\"556\" /></a></div>\n<div style=\"position: relative; display: inline-block; max-width: 100%;\"><img alt=\"V3a1 rolestory game placebg.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png/400px-V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"400\" height=\"41\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/1a/V3a1_rolestory_game_placebg.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"588\" data-file-height=\"60\" />\n<div style=\"position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); white-space: nowrap;\"><img alt=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/15px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"style=vertical-align: middle; margin: 0; padding: 0;\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png/23px-V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b5/V3a1_rolestory_game_icon_place.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"24\" data-file-height=\"28\" /><span style=\"display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; font-size: 14px;margin-left: 20px; color: #cccccc\">第一防线学校·走廊</span></div>\n</div><br />\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>拉文德：</b></span>“玛蒂尔达小姐，您要做什么？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>在纪律主任走出教室前那短短几秒的空隙，拉文德扯住了玛蒂尔达的衣角。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“你早就知道了，对不对？为什么不告诉我？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>但在看清拉文德的表情后，她吞下了原本要说的话。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“别担心，看我的吧。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>拉文德：</b></span>“可——”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>教室的门被打开，纪律主任眼神像是削尖的刀子。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>纪律主任：</b></span>“布翁尼小姐，你最好抓紧时间，我并不空闲。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“……我想请问，为什么有这么多学生没能参加校外活动？评比机制是怎么回事？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“这应该和Z女士最初提议增设校外活动日的初衷不符。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>纪律主任：</b></span>“你想说什么？这是学校的决定。”<br />\n玛蒂尔达深吸了一口气，呼吸有些发颤，但她已经做了决定——<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div class=\"tabber\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"tabber-filter filter-button left auto-first\" style=\"\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"她要说服对方\">她要说服对方</div></div>\n<div></div></div>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“那这个决定错了。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>她曾决定今天要“老老实实”地度过，但她改变主意了。<br />\n过去发生过类似的事，那时她也是教室里孩子们中的一员。那时只要有人路过窗外，她就会抬头去看，指望有哪个大人能够站出来说些“公道话”……<br />\n那个人没有出现。<br />\n但现在，她可以成为教室里孩子们期盼的那个大人。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>纪律主任：</b></span>“错了？你最好听听你在说什么。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>纪律主任：</b></span>“我们早早就通知了所有学生，如果有人触犯校规或成绩不合格，就会失去参加校外活动的机会。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>纪律主任：</b></span>“但这些小孩仍然没有放在心上。他们依然调皮捣蛋，敷衍功课……这对那些守纪律的好孩子来说又公平吗？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div class=\"tabber\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"tabber-filter filter-button left auto-first\" style=\"\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"不是这个问题\">不是这个问题</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"可是……可是……\">可是……可是……</div></div>\n<div>\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"可是……可是……\">\n<p>玛蒂尔达一时间没能找出最合适的话语，她试图重振旗鼓，但似乎有些迟了。纪律主任已决定结束话题。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>纪律主任：</b></span>“布翁尼小姐，我建议你谨言慎行。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>纪律主任：</b></span>“如果你没有别的事，我要回去看自习了。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“等等！”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>玛蒂尔达忽然灵光一闪。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“至少……至少不要把他们关在教室里了吧？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>纪律主任：</b></span>“……你这是什么意思？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“就算他们不能参加校外活动，也没有规定说他们在学校里必须自习，对不对？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>纪律主任没有回答。看来她猜对了。<br />\n</p>\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"不是这个问题\">\n<div class=\"tabber\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"tabber-filter filter-button left auto-first\" style=\"\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"&#91;&#91;File:Rolestory_madierda_pic1_1.png|100px|link=&#93;&#93;&lt;br&gt;纪律“协助”\"><img alt=\"Rolestory madierda pic1 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Rolestory_madierda_pic1_1.png/100px-Rolestory_madierda_pic1_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"84\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Rolestory_madierda_pic1_1.png/150px-Rolestory_madierda_pic1_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/17/Rolestory_madierda_pic1_1.png/200px-Rolestory_madierda_pic1_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"813\" data-file-height=\"680\" /><br />纪律“协助”</div></div>\n<div></div></div>\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“表现得好确实该得到奖励，犯了错误的确该受到惩罚。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“但这样的惩罚是不合适的！”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>她看向教室中那一双双偷偷望过来的、满是希冀的眼睛。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“哪怕是您口中的‘坏孩子’，也有权利对外面的世界感到好奇，有权利了解自己降生的这个世界的模样。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“您应该知道这个机会对他们来说有多珍贵。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div class=\"tabber\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"tabber-filter filter-button left auto-first\" style=\"\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"所有的孩子都该有这个权利\">所有的孩子都该有这个权利</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"所以……所以……\">所以……所以……</div></div>\n<div>\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"所以……所以……\">\n<p>玛蒂尔达一时间没能找出最合适的话语，她试图重振旗鼓，但似乎有些迟了。纪律主任已决定结束话题。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>纪律主任：</b></span>“布翁尼小姐，我建议你谨言慎行。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>纪律主任：</b></span>“如果你没有别的事，我要回去看自习了。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“等等！”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>玛蒂尔达忽然灵光一闪。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“至少……至少不要把他们关在教室里了吧？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>纪律主任：</b></span>“……你这是什么意思？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“就算他们不能参加校外活动，也没有规定说他们在学校里必须自习，对不对？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>纪律主任没有回答。看来她猜对了。<br />\n</p>\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"所有的孩子都该有这个权利\">\n<div class=\"tabber\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"tabber-filter filter-button left auto-first\" style=\"\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"&#91;&#91;File:Rolestory_madierda_pic3_1.png|100px|link=&#93;&#93;&lt;br&gt;不确定也即可能性\"><img alt=\"Rolestory madierda pic3 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/Rolestory_madierda_pic3_1.png/100px-Rolestory_madierda_pic3_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"84\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/Rolestory_madierda_pic3_1.png/150px-Rolestory_madierda_pic3_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/ff/Rolestory_madierda_pic3_1.png/200px-Rolestory_madierda_pic3_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"813\" data-file-height=\"680\" /><br />不确定也即可能性</div></div>\n<div></div></div>\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“Z女士当初向校委会提出增设校外活动日的目的，是让所有学生在安全和有正确引导的前提下，有更多了解校外事物的渠道。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“去年的通知上也是这么写的，它现在还贴在一楼大厅里呢。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“您听到了，哈珀女士——上面写的是‘所有学生’。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>纪律主任：</b></span>“你到底想要说什么，纪律协助教员玛蒂尔达·布翁尼小姐？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“我——”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<div class=\"tabber\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"tabber-filter filter-button left auto-first\" style=\"\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"他们应该参加校外活动\">他们应该参加校外活动</div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"我想……我想……\">我想……我想……</div></div>\n<div>\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"我想……我想……\">\n<p>玛蒂尔达一时间没能找出最合适的话语，她试图重振旗鼓，但似乎有些迟了。纪律主任已决定结束话题。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>纪律主任：</b></span>“布翁尼小姐，我建议你谨言慎行。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>纪律主任：</b></span>“如果你没有别的事，我要回去看自习了。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“等等！”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>玛蒂尔达忽然灵光一闪。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“至少……至少不要把他们关在教室里了吧？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>纪律主任：</b></span>“……你这是什么意思？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“就算他们不能参加校外活动，也没有规定说他们在学校里必须自习，对不对？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>纪律主任没有回答。看来她猜对了。<br />\n</p>\n</div><div class=\"tabber-item\" style=\"display: none;\" data-title=\"他们应该参加校外活动\">\n<div class=\"tabber\" style=\"\">\n<div class=\"tabber-filter filter-button left auto-first\" style=\"\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"title\" data-title=\"&#91;&#91;File:Rolestory_madierda_pic2_1.png|100px|link=&#93;&#93;&lt;br&gt;悬浮定止！\"><img alt=\"Rolestory madierda pic2 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Rolestory_madierda_pic2_1.png/100px-Rolestory_madierda_pic2_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"79\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Rolestory_madierda_pic2_1.png/150px-Rolestory_madierda_pic2_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ec/Rolestory_madierda_pic2_1.png/200px-Rolestory_madierda_pic2_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"860\" data-file-height=\"680\" /><br />悬浮定止！</div></div>\n<div></div></div>\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“我会带他们去。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>纪律主任：</b></span>“你？”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>纪律主任抬高了声音，瞪着玛蒂尔达，那眼神就好像她变成了另一种生物。<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p><span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>纪律主任：</b></span>“你没有权力这么做，就连我也没有。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>纪律主任：</b></span>“布翁尼小姐，你太不理智了。你不知道自己在做什么。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“我知道我在做什么。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“门就在我的手边，我只需要打开它，大家就能出来了。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“我刚才遇到了‘剃刀’小队的人，他们应该有车，可以载我们去现场。有他们的陪同会很安全。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“可能这些孩子会错过上午的活动，但现在过去，至少还能赶上野餐和下午的实践体验。”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>纪律主任：</b></span>“……你知道这样做会有什么后果吗？”<br />\n<span style=\"color: #bc9567;\"><b>玛蒂尔达：</b></span>“我明白，哈珀女士。”<br />\n</p>\n<hr class=\"rolestory-para\" />\n<p>玛蒂尔达向前走了几步，将手握上教室的门把手。<br />\n她打开了那扇门。<br />\n</p>\n</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "交接日-07"}}